#  (public domain); reproduced with attribution.
#
#  This is a REAL capture of the Canon RC-6 wireless remote
#  trigger (shutter release); the `data:` timing line below is
#  reproduced verbatim from the source.
#
#  Use: set the camera to IR remote-control mode (models listed
#  below), point the Flipper IR emitter at the camera receiver
#  and send "Trigger" to release the shutter.
#
#  Honest limits: verify against your own camera before relying
#  on it -- not every EOS body listens for RC-6 on every firmware.
# ==============================================================
#
# Remote trigger compatible with the following Canon models
#
# EOS 5DS / 5DS R
# EOS 600D
# EOS 7D
# EOS 450D
# EOS 550D
# EOS 5D Mark III
# EOS 90D
# EOS D30
# EOS M5
